WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:01.708
Everyone here in Gridiron Heights

00:00:01.708 --> 00:00:02.916
is gearing up for the only game

00:00:02.916 --> 00:00:04.250
that truly matters:

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.833
the Pro Bowl.

00:00:07.958 --> 00:00:08.833
AGAIN.

00:00:08.833 --> 00:00:10.916
You boys didn’t practice for two whole days

00:00:10.916 --> 00:00:12.625
to lose this game. AGAIN.

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.500
CLEAR EYES.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.166
FULL HEARTS.

00:00:14.166 --> 00:00:15.416
PRO BOWL!!!

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:17.083
Coach, I got the votes.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:17.750
I can play.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.375
Son, I am so proud of you.

00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:20.791
You’re a Pro Bowl alternate.

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:21.791
Here’s to God

00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:22.291
football

00:00:22.291 --> 00:00:24.125
and the 2019 AFC Pro Bowl team.

00:00:24.125 --> 00:00:25.208
AFC FOREVER!!!

00:00:25.208 --> 00:00:26.625
You guys are my brothers.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:27.541
Hey, I’m JuJu by the way.

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:28.458
I play for the Steelers.

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:29.375
- My name is Keenan Allen.
- Hi I’m Quenton Nelson.

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:30.583
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:31.500
Wow.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.875
The Camping World Stadium in Orlando, Florida.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:35.416
Doesn’t get much better than this.

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:37.166
They play the Citrus Bowl here...

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:38.416
OK boys, we’re just going to play

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:39.666
good ol’ half-speed football

00:00:39.666 --> 00:00:40.875
with minimal tackling.

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:41.791
OH, I’M SO BUMMED

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:43.500
I CAN’T PLAY IN THIS BIG GAME.

00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:44.875
WIN THIS FOR ME, SON.

00:00:44.875 --> 00:00:46.166
Pro Bowls and memories.

00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.333
That’s all you got.

00:00:47.333 --> 00:00:48.250
YOU BEST PLAY 3!

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.875
YOU’RE EMBARRASSING ME, COACH.

00:00:49.875 --> 00:00:51.125
3...you’re in.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:51.625
Hut hut!

00:00:51.625 --> 00:00:52.208
Wilson takes the snap.

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:53.333
Oh, Miller’s coming for him!

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.333
There you go. There you go.

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:55.250
Goodnight.

00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.208
[Gasps]

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:57.708
We want to apologize to the millions

00:00:57.708 --> 00:00:58.500
and millions of children

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.000
at home watching the Pro Bowl.

